 8️⃣ Zero-Downtime Deployment Flow (Step-by-Step)

1. New Docker image built
2. Kubernetes creates new Pod
3. Pod starts → readiness probe fails
4. App fully starts → readiness probe passes
5. Traffic routed to new Pod
6. Old pod drained & terminated
7. No request dropped 🚀

