| Tool               | Purpose              |
| ------------------ | -------------------- |
| Flyway / Liquibase | Versioned migrations |
| Cloud SQL          | Managed DB           |
| Read replicas      | Load isolation       |
| Feature flags      | Safe toggles         |

---

 🚀 DB Migration + Deployment Flow

```
Deploy v1 (compatible)
↓
Apply DB expand migration
↓
Deploy v2
↓
Backfill data
↓
Remove old fields
```

