 1️⃣ Service Mesh vs eBPF (Istio vs Cilium-Level Thinking)

 🧠 Core Difference

 Service Mesh → L7, proxy-based (Envoy sidecars)
 eBPF → L3–L7, kernel-based (no sidecars)

```
Service Mesh:
App → Envoy → Network → Envoy → App

eBPF:
App → Kernel (eBPF) → Network
```

