 Offline-first systems

 How

 Mathematical merge rules
 No rollback
 No locks

 Example

```
Inventory counter replicated globally
+2 in India
+3 in US
Final = 5
```

Used in:

 Counters
 Presence
 Collaborative edits

---

 🔄 Sagas (Workflow-Level)

 What They Solve

 Distributed transactions
 Business correctness
 Compensation logic

 How

 Sequence of steps
 Each step has a compensating action

 Example (Payment)

```
Reserve inventory
→ Charge payment
→ Create order

Failure?
→ Refund payment
→ Release inventory
```

Used in:

 Orders
 Payments
 Booking systems

